      "message": "refactor(vector): flatten nested if conditions in vsetvli\n\nRefactor the vsetvli IDL operation() code to flatten the nested\nif-else structure for better readability. The previous implementation\nused nested if blocks which increased indentation depth unnecessarily.\n\nChanges:\n- Flatten `if (xs1 == 0) { if (xd != 0) ... } else { ... }` into\n  a single `if/else if/else if/else` chain\n- Add descriptive comments for each case:\n  - xs1 == 0 && xd != 0: set vl to VLMAX\n  - xs1 == 0 && xd == 0: keep existing vl (with ratio check)\n  - Normal stripmining cases for AVL comparisons\n- Add space around `*` operator for consistency (`2 * vlmax`)\n\nThis improves code readability without changing functionality.\n\nCloses #1270\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
